        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Coordinated Distraction"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory or visual, concentrate)\n\nWith a sharp whistle or wave of their hand, the mercenary distracts an opponent so one of the mercenary's allies can land a clean blow. The mercenary chooses a target and an ally, both of whom must be within 30 feet of the mercenary. The target is flat-footed against the first Strike the mercenary's ally makes on its next turn; if the ally doesn't Strike that target, the effect is lost. Depending on how the mercenary distracts their foe, this action gains either the auditory or visual trait."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
